    `cp4 an amount multiplied by the Pension Index ratio for months from the first event` `the amount calculated as provided in subsection (3.2)` month `the months in which one of the events described in paragraphs (3)(a) to (e) occurred` `the ratio that the Pension Index for the year that includes that month bears to the Pension Index for the year in which the contributor died`

-- src:1823 | (3.2) The amount to be calculated for the purpose of subsection (3.1) is equal to
-- src:1824 | (a) if a retirement pension was not payable for the month in which the contributor died, an amount equal to 8.33% of their first additional monthly pensionable earnings, or
-- src:1825 | (b) if a retirement pension was payable for the month in which the contributor died, an amount equal to the product obtained by multiplying
-- src:1826 | (i) an amount equal to 8.33% of their first additional monthly pensionable earnings,
-- src:1827 | by
-- src:1828 | (ii) the ratio that the Pension Index for the year that includes that month bears to the Pension Index for the year in which the retirement pension first became payable.
@ref Act s 58(3.2) (src:1823-1828)
GIVEN `a retirement pension was payable for the month in which the contributor died` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the first additional monthly pensionable earnings` IS A NUMBER
      `the ratio that the Pension Index for the year that includes that month bears to the Pension Index for the year in which the retirement pension first became payable` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 58(3.2) — the amount calculated for the purpose of subsection (3.1)` `a retirement pension was payable for the month in which the contributor died` `the first additional monthly pensionable earnings` `the ratio that the Pension Index for the year that includes that month bears to the Pension Index for the year in which the retirement pension first became payable` MEANS
    -- "that month" in (b)(ii) is the month in which the contributor died (NOTES.md, fork register).
    IF `a retirement pension was payable for the month in which the contributor died`
    THEN (8.33% TIMES `the first additional monthly pensionable earnings`) TIMES `the ratio that the Pension Index for the year that includes that month bears to the Pension Index for the year in which the retirement pension first became payable`
    ELSE 8.33% TIMES `the first additional monthly pensionable earnings`

